- `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/HexshmBu0P.md` (Diffusion Watermarking Recipe, avg 5.33, Reject): Extensive experiments but limited technical novelty and missing adversarial evaluation. SecureGS has more focused methodological innovations but suffers from more severely confounded comparisons and weaker robustness evaluation.
- `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/PCm1oT8pZI.md` (IP Protection, avg 5.75, Accept Poster): Solid empirical results with an incomplete threat model. SecureGS has a less complete security framework and misleading attribution of backbone gains.
